# shotsync targets: one per line, whitespace-separated.
#   name   ssh-host   remote_dir
# host is what you'd type in `ssh <host>`. remote_dir is relative to your home
# dir on the VM unless it starts with /. No spaces inside fields.
# The first target listed is the default.
#
# Examples (uncomment / edit):
# vm1      myvm        shots
# gpu      gpu-box     /data/shots
